    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, but I appreciate its logical structure. While it's not my strongest suit, I enjoy the problem-solving aspect and how it connects to physics, which I find more intuitive. I prefer learning through examples rather than abstract theories.",
